	<key>readme</key>
	<string>## Setup

Install Claude Code, run `claude` once in Terminal and log in with your Claude account. Messages then use your Claude plan, with no API key.

To pay per use instead, paste a Claude API key from the Claude Console into API Key. Claude Code still needs to be installed, but you don't need to log in.

The workflow finds Claude Code by itself in the usual install locations. If it can't, run `which claude` in Terminal and paste the result into Claude Path.

## Usage

Launch the chat window with the `claude` keyword or the Hotkey.

Each chat keeps its own Claude Code session, so follow-up questions have the full conversation. You can switch models between messages.

Search your chats with the box above the list (⌘F), right-click a chat to copy or delete it, and move between chats with ⌘] and ⌘[.</string>
